# Rasaoi Frontend Rules

Read `src/CURSOR.md` and `.cursor/CONTEXT_PLAN.md` before editing.

## Conventions

- `@/` import alias maps to `src/`
- Domain components in `components/`; shadcn primitives in `components/ui/` — extend, don't replace
- Brand tokens in `index.css`; use `cn()` from `lib/utils.ts`
- Functional components + hooks only — no global state store

## Patterns

- Pages orchestrate; `lib/` scores/filters; components render
- Edge calls wrapped in `src/lib/*.ts` via `supabase.functions.invoke()`
- State via `useState`/`useEffect` + localStorage/sessionStorage helpers — not React Query
- New routes in `App.tsx` above the `*` catch-all

## Required Sync on Change

- Dietary logic → also update `supabase/functions/_shared/dietary.ts`
- Intent sanitizer → also update `supabase/functions/_shared/intent-sanitize.ts`
- Scoring → add regression in `src/lib/*.test.ts`
- Mock fixtures → sync edge fixture in `places-search/fixtures/`
